# Copy this file's variable names into Vercel Project Settings -> Environment
# Variables. Nothing here is required for the app to work - without them the
# DTR app runs exactly as it does today, with manually-entered tracking
# numbers and no live carrier status.

# Enables live carrier tracking (AfterShip). Sign up at aftership.com, create
# an API key under Settings -> API Keys, and paste it here.
AFTERSHIP_API_KEY=

# Optional but recommended once AFTERSHIP_API_KEY is set: verifies that
# incoming /api/track-webhook requests really came from AfterShip. Find this
# under AfterShip -> Settings -> Webhooks after you create the webhook
# pointing at https://<your-vercel-domain>/api/track-webhook.
AFTERSHIP_WEBHOOK_SECRET=

# Optional: protects /api/track-cron (the daily fallback status sweep) from
# being called by anyone who finds the URL. Vercel automatically sends this
# value as a Bearer token when it invokes a Cron Job - just set the same
# value here and in the Vercel dashboard.
CRON_SECRET=

# Optional overrides. The app already has the current Supabase project URL
# and anon key embedded in index.html and api/_shared.js - only set these if
# you rotate the anon key and want the /api functions to pick up the new one
# without editing code.
SUPABASE_URL=
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
